{{!
    ROFEO FAQ section, included from theme_moove/frontpage between the "why
    choose us" section and the footer. Self-contained: gated on faqenabled
    here, so the include is a no-op when the section is disabled or empty.

    Note for anyone editing this file: avoid writing literal double-brace
    tag examples inside this comment block. Mustache comments end at the
    first closing brace pair they contain, wherever it falls, so a tag
    reference written in full inside the comment text closes the comment
    early and turns the rest of this block into literal page output.

    The section id is "rofeo-faq", not "faq" - moove ships its own #faq
    accordion styling in scss/moove/_frontpage.scss, scoped to logged-out
    visitors (#page-site-index.notloggedin #faq ...), which silently wins
    against this theme's accordion overrides by specificity when the id
    collides. Keep this id theme-owned.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * faqenabled - true only when the admin has enabled the section AND at
      least one question/answer pair has content, supplied by
      layout/frontpage.php
    * faqtitle, faqsubtitle - theme_rofeo settings
    * faqitems - array of id, question, answer, active
}}
{{#faqenabled}}
    <section class="rofeo-faq" id="rofeo-faq">
        <div class="rofeo-faq__inner">
            <h2 class="rofeo-faq__heading">{{{ faqtitle }}}</h2>
            {{#faqsubtitle}}
                <div class="rofeo-faq__subtitle">{{{ faqsubtitle }}}</div>
            {{/faqsubtitle}}

            <div class="accordion rofeo-faq__accordion" id="rofeo-faq-accordion">
                {{#faqitems}}
                    <div class="accordion-item rofeo-faq__item">
                        <h3 class="accordion-header">
                            <button class="accordion-button {{^active}}collapsed{{/active}}" type="button"
                                    data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#rofeo-faq-collapse-{{id}}"
                                    aria-expanded="{{#active}}true{{/active}}{{^active}}false{{/active}}"
                                    aria-controls="rofeo-faq-collapse-{{id}}">
                                {{{ question }}}
                            </button>
                        </h3>
                        <div id="rofeo-faq-collapse-{{id}}" class="accordion-collapse collapse {{#active}}show{{/active}}"
                             data-bs-parent="#rofeo-faq-accordion">
                            <div class="accordion-body">
                                {{{ answer }}}
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                {{/faqitems}}
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
{{/faqenabled}}
